From e34fd13a3a8cd27669b9693da717c06bd55f086b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: therealmharc <therealmharc@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:01:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Allow gallery open while photo still saving

The thumbnail tap validates the photo file with openFile and aborts the
launch when it returns FileNotFoundException. The MediaStore row insert
precedes the async postprocess write, so tapping right after the shutter
hits ENOENT and the gallery never opens. Force this uri check to pass;
the viewer resolves the uri at its own pace once the file lands.
---
 smali/com/android/camera/Camera.smali | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/smali/com/android/camera/Camera.smali b/smali/com/android/camera/Camera.smali
index 3def63b0..65dfd6de 100644
--- a/smali/com/android/camera/Camera.smali
+++ b/smali/com/android/camera/Camera.smali
@@ -4752,6 +4752,8 @@
 
     move-result v2
 
+    const/4 v2, 0x1
+
     if-nez v2, :cond_4
 
     :goto_1
-- 
2.56.0

